{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23256","headline":"晚岁 · 白居易","name":"晚岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壮岁忽已去，浮荣何足论。\n身爲百口长，官是一州尊。\n不觉白双鬓，徒言朱两轓。\n病难施郡政，老未荅君恩。\n岁暮别兄弟，年衰无子孙。\n惹愁谙世网，治苦赖空门。\n擥带知腰瘦，看灯觉眼昏。\n不缘衣食系，寻合返丘园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}